---
const { payouts } = Astro.props;
---
<div id="rules" class="cell locked">
    <h1 class="text-2xl underline">Rules</h1>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>The Pot will consist of the sum of the paid squares</li>
        <li>The numbers will be randomized 30mins prior to the game start or once the board is fill. Which ever is fisrt</li>
        <li>All numbers will be rolled by <a href="https://www.random.org/">RANDOM.ORG</a></li>
        <li class="italic text-blue-600">Why different numbers each quater? If the score doesn't change this means someone else will win. This will keep low score games more interesting and have more winners  </li>
        <li>Payouts willl ramp up each quarter. Here are the pertentage payouts for each quarter:</li>
        <li style="list-style:none">
            <div class="flex flex-row justify-start gap-4">
                <span class="cell inline locked accent">End of Q1:  <strong class="px-2">{payouts[0]*100}%</strong></span>
                <span class="cell inline locked accent">Halftime:   <strong class="px-2">{payouts[1]*100}%</strong></span>
                <span class="cell inline locked accent">End of Q3:  <strong class="px-2">{payouts[2]*100}%</strong></span>
                <span class="cell inline locked accent">Final:      <strong class="px-2">{payouts[3]*100}%</strong></span>
            </div>
        </li>
        <li>The winning square for a given quarter will be determined by the <span class="underline">last digit of each of the teams' score</span>.
            <ul class="ml-6 cell locked p-0">
                <li class="pl-1">
                    <span class="underline italic">example</span>: NFC Champion has 17 at the end of the first. The winning number will be <span class="">7</span></i> 
                </li>
                <li class="pl-1 bg-slate-300">
                    <span class="underline italic">example</span>: AFC Champion has 6 at the end of the game. The winning number will be <code>6</code>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li class="italic text-blue-600"><span class="font-bold">This simplified scoring is new for this year</span> 
        </li>
        <li>I reserve the right to remove unpaid square requests at any point before numbers are picked.</li>
        <li> Unclaimed/unpaid squares that win, will splash the payout </a>to the cardinal 4 directions in an equal payout (recursively until all money has been distributed)
            <div class="ml-6 w-fit wrapper cell locked object-fill">
                <img class="h-full" src="../img/squares/splash_diagram.jpg" alt="Example of splash payouts">
            </div>
        </li>
        <li>If you have any problems picking squares, please text Jess or I. If you don't specify a square, or the square requested is taken we will pick the next sequentially availiable</li>
    </ul>
</CollapsibleSection>